The land of the sealed
Unlocked only with the sealed key, the land of the sealed is a place having three different maps, with dangerous mythical creatures. You can earn money and items, as well as xp by killing these creatures.
Requirements, must have the sealed key, which can be gained through completing the story mode, or bought in the crystal mall.
A total of three maps, the list being as follows
Ancient seal, contains creatures such as ancient birds, as well as Greek monsters
Mythical seal, contains creatures such as wear wolfs and wendigoes.
Prehistoric seal, contains dinosaurs